 "title": "Rockstar and PlayStation disagree on GTA 6's unlock time",
 "audio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Lh3gaSoJDsjYAzqFyj65XamsxE/hf_20261114_053421_0dd28b36-cc9b-40f1-9962-f4bb2442bd90.wav",
 "script": "Rockstar and PlayStation seem to disagree about when GTA 6 unlocks. Rockstar's support page says midnight local time on November 19, in all regions. PlayStation's blog says a rolling midnight launch by country, starting in New Zealand. For small countries, that's the same thing. But in places with several time zones, like the United States, the west coast could start the night before, or wait for its own midnight. Digital Foundry asked Rockstar which is right. I couldn't find an answer yet. Until then, check the countdown on your console after pre-load. When does yours unlock? Comment your country.",
